{"project":{"uuid":"a5dedfc619cd4e11aa536cd5fa082c25","name":"Scaned","slug":"scaned-dd92","tagline":"Taking healthcare to next level","description":[{"hint":"","title":"The problem it solves","content":"Scaned is an AI-powered website where the user can upload an X-ray/CT scan image to get predictions from 21 diseases using a Deep Learning-based model. Once the image Is uploaded, it will predict a disease that has a high probability. We will also have a Multilingual bot which will be helpful in customer support and FAQ. Healthcare being a sensitive area we will be adding AI explainability using Class Activation Map methods. We will also be showing nearby healthcare centres to the diagnosed patient.","subtitle":"describe what can people use it for, or how it makes existing tasks easier/safer e.t.c (markdown supported)"},{"hint":"","title":"Challenges we ran into","content":"Training deep learning models in such a short period was a major problem to overcome this we used Microsoft Azure virtual machines to train our modes ","subtitle":"tell us about any specific bug or hurdle you ran into while building this project. how did you get over it? (markdown supported)"}],"platforms":["Web"],"pictures":"hackathons/34ba0a3edc424f68b659d97e959f27d2/projects/38d25e86521942cf8917569e741403d4/048cfd77-521d-41f5-98a0-5e1b35158b00.png,hackathons/34ba0a3edc424f68b659d97e959f27d2/projects/38d25e86521942cf8917569e741403d4/3e4a062a-189f-454b-8a8c-ee9921f63dfc.png","cover_img":null,"video_url":"https://youtu.be/5otRm0IGxag","links":"https://github.com/Adi-19/Scaned","status":"publish","discover":false,"likes":0,"views":15,"favicon":null,"architecture_diagram":null,"apply_for_network_school_fellowship_prize":null,"source_code_url":null,"by_student_team":false,"published_at":"2022-02-26T07:00:15.001Z","created_at":"2022-02-26T07:00:10.049Z","hashtags":[{"uuid":"e09d7254f13c4a1c977dee126a85440d","name":"TensorFlow","verified":true,"project_hashtags":{}},{"uuid":"399ad273b92b499f9619364609